# Copy to .env.local (dev) / set in Cloudflare Pages build env (production).
# All three are TODO(VERIFY) — leave unset until real values exist. Do NOT
# commit real secrets; GA4/verification codes are not secrets but keep the
# production values in the deploy environment, not this template.

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (production only). Inlined at build time
# into the client bundle. Empty = analytics disabled.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA4_ID=

# Google Search Console verification code (content of the google-site-verification
# meta tag). Server-side build-time value. Empty = tag omitted.
GSC_VERIFICATION=
